/T (With only 1 robot: The activity works perfectly well with just one type of robot. Choose the one that matches your budget and objectives. Sphero Indi is very accessible for beginners; the micro:bit robot offers more possibilities but requires a bit more familiarisation. Cubetto is interesting because it offers a puzzle-like challenge for pupils, but it is more expensive and has limited reusability as it is designed for very young children.)
