408 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 212 0 R
/E (A Fun Entry Point into Robotics: Robotics is not just about code and circuits. It is also an invitation to question our humanity: what is learning? What differentiates human intelligence from artificial intelligence? Can robots truly "understand" or do they just calculate? These philosophical questions emerge naturally from the activity.)
/Pg 11 0 R
/K [19]
>>
